5. **Debug logging** - Multiple `log.debug('APA01 …')` calls scattered throughout `render.ts` (ELK), `render.ts` (cose-bilkent), and `render.ts` (tidy-tree) are development-only noise that should be removed before merging.

6. **`instructions.md`** - A one-line scratch file committed at the repository root. Should not be committed.

7. **`knsv2.html`** - All newly added `<pre>` elements share `id="diagram4"`, making the HTML invalid and causing unpredictable JS behavior.

